Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Dynamic Data Lists,Workflow|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Dynamic Data Lists,Workflow|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
		|workflowAssetType|Dynamic Data Lists Record|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Edit DDL Record Via My Workflow Tasks
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLDataDefinition save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
		|ddlListName|DDL List Name|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
		|ddlListName|DDL List Name|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|DDL Record 1|
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLRecord submit For Publication
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
		|ddlListName|DDL List Name|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|DDL Record 2|
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLRecord submit For Publication
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
		|workflowAssetTitle|New Data Definition Name for List: DDL List Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Dynamic Data Lists Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
		|workflowAssetContent|DDL Record|
		|workflowAssetTitle|New Data Definition Name for List: DDL List Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Dynamic Data Lists Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow goto Preview Edit
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|DDL Record Edit|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And PortletEntry save
	And DDLRecord view Edit Preview
		|ddlRecordFieldDataEdit|DDL Record Edit|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	Then Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition Name|
		|workflowAssetContent|DDL Record Edit|
		|workflowAssetTitle|New Data Definition Name for List: DDL List Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Dynamic Data Lists Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
